    {
      "id": "q05",
      "source_numbers": [
        "282"
      ],
      "view": {
        "mode": "single",
        "stem": "三个数列分别由 $u_n=2^n$、$v_n=5\\cdot3^n$、$w_n=3\\cdot2^{n+1}$ 给出。哪一组论证能证明这三个数列都是等比数列？",
        "figure_ids": [],
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "a",
            "text": "对任意 $n\\ge1$，$\\frac{u_{n+1}}{u_n}=4$，$\\frac{v_{n+1}}{v_n}=9$，$\\frac{w_{n+1}}{w_n}=4$；各比值不依赖 $n$，故三个数列都是等比数列。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "b",
            "text": "对任意 $n\\ge1$，$\\frac{u_{n+1}}{u_n}=2$，$\\frac{v_{n+1}}{v_n}=15$，$\\frac{w_{n+1}}{w_n}=6$；各比值不依赖 $n$，故三个数列都是等比数列。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "c",
            "text": "对任意 $n\\ge1$，$\\frac{u_{n+1}}{u_n}=2$，$\\frac{v_{n+1}}{v_n}=3$，$\\frac{w_{n+1}}{w_n}=2$；各比值不依赖 $n$，故三个数列都是等比数列。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "d",
            "text": "对任意 $n\\ge1$，$\\frac{u_{n+1}}{u_n}=\\frac12$，$\\frac{v_{n+1}}{v_n}=\\frac13$，$\\frac{w_{n+1}}{w_n}=\\frac12$；各比值不依赖 $n$，故三个数列都是等比数列。",
            "figure_ids": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
